Patch from MiniMyth2 project

Developed-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>




Extend code to dealing with failing tee fw loading viao optee with rsa_verify 0xffff3072 (TEE_ERROR_SIGNATURE_INVALID).
It adds in tee load command the second value param carrying the signed-block.
Without this - on some TV Boxes like A95X-F3-Air-II the TA receives all chunks (need next data block … up to the full size) 
and then fails rsa_verify 0xffff3072.
For such cases You need to add --signed-block at amvdec-tee invocation

Issue discovery is by great work of domeneponuda-beep (milion thx for this!)

